### =============================================================================
### APPLICATION MANAGEMENT TESTS - API Gateway (Port 4000)
### =============================================================================

### 1. Create Internship Application (Student)
POST http://localhost:4000/applications
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{student_token}}

{
  "application_type": "internship",
  "type_specific_data": {
    "company": "TechCorp Tunisia",
    "position": "Software Developer Intern",
    "duration_months": 6,
    "start_date": "2025-07-01",
    "supervisor_name": "Ahmed Ben Ali",
    "supervisor_email": "ahmed.benali@techcorp.tn",
    "description": "Full-stack development internship focusing on React and Node.js",
    "requirements": "Basic knowledge of JavaScript, React, and databases"
  }
}

### 2. Create Incubation Application (Incubé)
POST http://localhost:4000/applications
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{incube_token}}

{
  "application_type": "incubation",
  "type_specific_data": {
    "project_name": "EcoTech Solutions",
    "business_model": "B2B SaaS platform for environmental monitoring",
    "target_market": "Small to medium enterprises in Tunisia",
    "funding_amount": "50000",
    "team_size": 4,
    "project_stage": "MVP Development",
    "description": "IoT-based environmental monitoring platform for businesses"
  }
}

### 3. Create PFE Application (Student)
POST http://localhost:4000/applications
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{student_token}}

{
  "application_type": "pfe",
  "type_specific_data": {
    "title": "Machine Learning for Predictive Maintenance in Manufacturing",
    "supervisor_name": "Dr. Fatma Zohra",
    "company": "ManufacTech Industries",
    "academic_year": "2024-2025",
    "specialization": "Computer Science - AI Track",
    "objectives": "Develop an ML model to predict equipment failures and optimize maintenance schedules",
    "methodology": "Data collection, feature engineering, model training using Python and TensorFlow",
    "expected_outcomes": "Working prototype with 85%+ accuracy in failure prediction"
  }
}

### 4. Create Application with Invalid Type
POST http://localhost:4000/applications
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{student_token}}

{
  "application_type": "invalid_type",
  "type_specific_data": {
    "company": "Should Fail"
  }
}

### 5. Create Application with Mismatched Type and Data
POST http://localhost:4000/applications
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{student_token}}

{
  "application_type": "internship",
  "type_specific_data": {
    "project_name": "This should fail",
    "business_model": "Mismatch"
  }
}

### 6. Create Application without Authentication
POST http://localhost:4000/applications
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "application_type": "internship",
  "type_specific_data": {
    "company": "Should Fail"
  }
}

### 7. Create Application with Missing Required Fields
POST http://localhost:4000/applications
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{student_token}}

{
  "application_type": "internship",
  "type_specific_data": {
    "company": "Missing Position"
  }
}

### =============================================================================
### LIST APPLICATIONS
### =============================================================================

### 8. List Applications (Student - Own Only)
GET http://localhost:4000/applications
Authorization: Bearer {{student_token}}

### 9. List Applications (Admin - All)
GET http://localhost:4000/applications
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token}}

### 10. List Applications (Encadrant - All)
GET http://localhost:4000/applications
Authorization: Bearer {{encadrant_token}}

### 11. List Applications (Unauthorized)
GET http://localhost:4000/applications

### =============================================================================
### GET APPLICATION BY ID
### =============================================================================

### 12. Get Application by ID (Owner)
GET http://localhost:4000/applications/{{application_id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{student_token}}

### 13. Get Application by ID (Admin)
GET http://localhost:4000/applications/{{application_id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token}}

### 14. Get Application by ID (Encadrant)
GET http://localhost:4000/applications/{{application_id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{encadrant_token}}

### 15. Get Application by ID (Not Owner - Should Fail)
GET http://localhost:4000/applications/{{other_user_application_id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{student_token}}

### 16. Get Application by ID (Invalid ID)
GET http://localhost:4000/applications/invalid-uuid
Authorization: Bearer {{student_token}}

### 17. Get Application by ID (Unauthorized)
GET http://localhost:4000/applications/{{application_id}}

### =============================================================================
### UPDATE APPLICATIONS
### =============================================================================

#### ERORR

### 18. Update Application (Owner - Draft Status)
PUT http://localhost:4000/applications/{{application_id}}
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{student_token}}

{
  "type_specific_data": {
    "company": "Updated TechCorp Tunisia",
    "position": "Senior Software Developer Intern",
    "duration_months": 3,
    "start_date": "2025-07-01",
    "supervisor_name": "Ahmed Ben Ali",
    "supervisor_email": "ahmed.benali@techcorp.tn",
    "description": "Updated: Advanced full-stack development internship with DevOps exposure",
    "requirements": "Intermediate knowledge of JavaScript, React, Node.js, and Docker"
  }
}

### 19. Update Application (PATCH method)
PATCH http://localhost:4000/applications/{{application_id}}
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{student_token}}

{
  "type_specific_data": {
    "company": "PATCH Updated Company",
    "position": "Software Developer Intern",
    "duration_months": 6,
    "start_date": "2025-07-01",
    "supervisor_name": "Ahmed Ben Ali",
    "supervisor_email": "ahmed.benali@techcorp.tn",
    "description": "PATCH update test",
    "requirements": "Basic JavaScript"
  },
  "feedback": "Self-updated application"
}

### 20. Update Application (Not Owner - Should Fail)
PUT http://localhost:4000/applications/{{other_user_application_id}}
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{student_token}}

{
  "type_specific_data": {
    "company": "Should Fail"
  }
}

### 21. Update Application (Admin - Can Update Any)
PUT http://localhost:4000/applications/{{application_id}}
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token}}

{
  "feedback": "Admin feedback added",
  "type_specific_data": {
    "company": "Admin Updated Company",
    "position": "Software Developer Intern",
    "duration_months": 8,
    "start_date": "2025-07-01",
    "supervisor_name": "Ahmed Ben Ali",
    "supervisor_email": "ahmed.benali@techcorp.tn",
    "description": "Admin updated this application",
    "requirements": "Admin requirements"
  }
}

### =============================================================================
### DELETE APPLICATIONS
### =============================================================================

### 22. Delete Application (Owner - Draft Status)
DELETE http://localhost:4000/applications/{{application_id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{student_token}}

### 23. Delete Application (Not Owner - Should Fail)
DELETE http://localhost:4000/applications/{{other_user_application_id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{student_token}}

### 24. Delete Application (Admin)
DELETE http://localhost:4000/applications/{{application_id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token}}

### 25. Delete Application (Invalid ID)
DELETE http://localhost:4000/applications/invalid-uuid
Authorization: Bearer {{student_token}}

### =============================================================================
### CHANGE APPLICATION STATUS (Admin/Encadrant Only)
### =============================================================================

### 26. Change Status to "En Attente" (Admin)
PATCH http://localhost:4000/applications/{{application_id}}/change_status
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token}}

{
  "status": "en_attente",
  "feedback": "Application is now under review"
}

### 27. Change Status to "Approuvée" (Encadrant)
PATCH http://localhost:4000/applications/{{other_user_application_id}}/change_status
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{encadrant_token}}

{
  "status": "approuvee",
  "feedback": "Application approved by supervisor. Excellent proposal!"
}

### 28. Change Status to "Rejetée" (Admin)
PATCH http://localhost:4000/applications/{{application_id}}/change_status
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token}}

{
  "status": "rejetee",
  "feedback": "Application rejected due to incomplete requirements"
}

### 29. Change Status to "Modification Demandée" (Encadrant)
PATCH http://localhost:4000/applications/{{application_id}}/change_status
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{encadrant_token}}

{
  "status": "modification_demandee",
  "feedback": "Please provide more details about the technical requirements and expected deliverables"
}

### 30. Change Status to "Brouillon" (Admin)
PATCH http://localhost:4000/applications/{{application_id}}/change_status
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token}}

{
  "status": "brouillon",
  "feedback": "Reset to draft status for revision"
}

